Counting the 1 bits of 13 with `x &= x − 1`:

| x | binary | x − 1 | x & (x − 1) | count |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 13 | 1101 | 1100 | 1100 = 12 | 1 |
| 12 | 1100 | 1011 | 1000 = 8 | 2 |
| 8 | 1000 | 0111 | 0000 = 0 | 3 |

